cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its artefacts, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "A Precondition Audit of Benchmark Datasets for Multi-Environment Causal Representation Learning"
abstract: >-
  Code and committed artefacts for a precondition audit of the datasets used to
  benchmark multi-environment causal representation learning: whether real
  perturbation data satisfies the environment-count, latent-dimension and
  spectrum assumptions that identifiability theorems require. Reports
  descriptives and simulator gates only; no real-data rank-test result is
  claimed.
